  "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 200 °C. Toss the onions in a baking dish with the spices and 4 tbsp olive oil.",
    "Cut the top off the garlic, drizzle with 1 tbsp oil, salt it and set it cut-side up on the onions.",
    "Cover with foil and bake 1 hour, tossing the onions every 20 minutes with a splash of water, until deep golden and jammy.",
    "Cook the pasta, keeping up to 1 cup of the water.",
    "Squeeze the roasted garlic into the onions, add the chilli crisp, cream, soy sauce, lemon juice, Parmesan and pasta, and toss with pasta water until glossy."
  ],
  "notes": "Good with chicken, shrimp or tofu."
